SUMMARY:Ask a Master Gardener
DESCRIPTION:Have a gardening question? Stop by the Family Garden in the McGovern Centennial Gardens between 9 a.m. to 12 p.m. and chat with Harris County Master Gardeners! Get expert advice on plants\, soil\, seasonal care\, and more—perfect for gardeners of all levels.
URL:https://hermannpark.org/event/ask-a-master-gardener-series-2/
LOCATION:McGovern Centennial Gardens\, 1500 Hermann Drive\, Houston\, TX\, 77004\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://hermannpark.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/mcg_family_garden_-_photo_by_lifted_up_aerial_photography-680x400-2.jpg
END:VEVENT
