SUMMARY:Moonlight Movie Nights: A Bug's Life
DESCRIPTION:As part of this summer’s Kicking It at Hermann Park offerings\, enjoy “Moonlight Movie Nights\,” presented by Goya\, in the Commons! On Saturday\, July 11\, join us for a showing of A Bug’s Life (1998 | G | 1h 35m runtime). \nThe movie will start at approximately 8:30 p.m.\, around sunset. The movie showing is free and open to the public. \nBe sure to get to the Commons early to snag your spot on the lawn. Guests are welcome to bring blankets or lawn chairs to settle in for the movie. \nFood and beverage will be available for purchase at the cafe and with food vendors on-site. \n📣 Please note: With storms in the forecast this weekend\, all events are weather dependent. Be sure to check our website and social media for the latest updates before attending. \nThank you to Goya for their generous support!
URL:https://hermannpark.org/event/moonlight-movie-nights-a-bugs-life/
LOCATION:The Commons
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://hermannpark.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/P1011987-scaled-e1779221087349.jpg
END:VEVENT
